   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT making an appropriation to pay Debra Gordon, widow of the late William\nR. Nojay, member of the assembly from the 133th assembly district, the balance\ndue of his unpaid annual compensation for a portion of the year 2016",
    "basePrintNo": "S7429",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7429-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Appropriations",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7429\n\nSPONSOR: GALLIVAN\n \nTITLE OF BILL:  An act making an appropriation to pay Debra Gordon,\nwidow of the late William R.  Nojay, member of the assembly from the\n133th assembly district, the balance due of his unpaid annual compen-\nsation for a portion of the year 2016\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo authorize payment of unpaid annual compensation to Debra Gordon,\nwidow of William R. Nojay, member of the Assembly from the 133th assem-\nbly district.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection one authorizes the sum of twenty-seven thousand two hundred\nthirty dollars and eighty-eight cents ($27,230.88) to be appropriated\nout of general fund for payment to Debra Gordon, the widow of the late\nWilliam R. Nojay, member of the Assembly, who died on the ninth day of\nSeptember, 2016, for the balance due of the unpaid annual compensation\nwhich would have been earned by him had he continued to live and serve\nas such member until the end of 2016. Section two is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nIt has been the tradition of the Legislature to pay widows or widowers\nthe unpaid salaries of the Spouses who die while they are members of the\nLegislature.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNew bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\n$27,230.88.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately.\n",
